 о работе своего подразделения:\n«Перед началом штурмовых действий тщательно разведали позиции противника. Уже во время наступления в воздухе висело 12 расчетов ударных беспилотников, которые по корректировке от штурмовых групп наносили удары по позициям противника, не давая им поднять головы».\n➡️ Присоединяйся к команде профессионалов. Узнай подробности на сайте Беспилотныевойска.рф и по телефону 117 (доб.4).\n#ВойскаБПС\n🔹 Канал Минобороны России в MAКС – только для своих!","media_ratio_pct":100.0,"media_too_big":true,"key":"ru_mod:69050#0"}],"possible_matches":[],"media":[{"url":"https://t.me/mod_russia/68986?single","platform":"tg","id":"mod_russia/68986","kind":"media","too_big":null,"ratio_pct":null,"from":"Ministry of Defence of Russia","found_by":"linked by the source"},{"url":"https://t.me/mod_russia/69050","platform":"tg","id":"mod_russia/69050","kind":"video","too_big":true,"ratio_pct":100.0,"from":"Ministry of Defence of Russia","found_by":"linked by the source"}]}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[37.742809,50.138475]},"properties":{"source":"events","source_name":"Events","id":"ev-cd248c490a","date":"2026-11-16","time_utc":"2026-11-16T07:46:00+00:00","category":"Equipment loss","categories":["Equipment loss"],"claim":"A halted Russian MT-LB and D-30 towed howitzer were destroyed by Ukrainian FPV drones.","side":"Russia","color":"#E00000","confidence":"high","confidence_reason":"geolocated footage","location":"geolocated","precision":"geolocated","place":"","claim_sources":["geoconfirmed"],"claims":[{"source":"geoconfirmed","source_name":"GeoConfirmed","kind":"geolocated database","category":"Equipment loss","claim":"A halted Russian MT-LB and D-30 towed howitzer were destroyed by Ukrainian FPV drones.","source_category":"Recently Destroyed/Damaged APC OR IFV / TRACKED or WHEELED / ARMOURED - Including vehicles like HUMVEE and similar","side":"Russia","color":"#E00000","date":"2026-11-16","time_utc":"2026-11-16T07:46:00+00:00